# 5. Viewing Tasks

I would check the task list after creating different tasks.

Some of the things I would verify are:

1. Newly created tasks are displayed.
2. Task information is displayed correctly.
3. The same task is not displayed twice.
4. Refreshing the page does not remove the task.
5. If there are no tasks, the application shows a proper empty-state message instead of a broken page.
6. A large number of tasks should still load correctly.
7. Most importantly, a user should only see their own tasks.

For example, if User A creates "Complete Project Report", User B should not be able to see that task.

